{"additions":3973,"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Closes #186\n\n## What\n\n- **`x`** on the issue or PR list (`GhListAction::ToggleClosed` → `PaneEvent::ToggleClosed`) toggles **both** lists between open items and all of them: `gh issue list --state all` / `gh pr list --state all`, the same `--limit 50`. Plain `gh` list calls — no GraphQL points.\n- Closed issues and merged / closed PRs render **dimmed** with their state icon (`✓` closed, `⊕` merged); the header reads `GitHub · closed` while they are in; a status message confirms each toggle.\n- **`github-show-closed \"on\" | \"off\"`** (default `off`) sets the start state (loader + validation, merge allowlist, `assets/default.kdl`).\n- The disk cache keeps only the open lists (`apply_list` skips saving while closed items are shown), so a start-up never shows a stale mixed list. The #177 change check re-fetches whichever variant is shown (`spawn_fetch` reads the pane's flag).\n- `GhListItem::fetch_list` takes the flag (runs ignore it).\n\n## Docs / demo\n\nGuide GitHub chapter (paragraph + key row, en / ja), Config Reference (`github-show-closed` section, table row, defaults dump, unknown-block list, en / ja), README (en / ja). Fixtures re-recorded: both list variants plus the details of every listed item (125 files, 1.4 MB); the GitHub issue demo presses `x` twice.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `x_toggles_closed_items_in_both_lists` (state: both panes flip and re-fetch, status message, config start state)\n- `github_show_closed_default_override_and_validation` (loader)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","changedFiles":143,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-10T06:13:56Z","deletions":6750,"headRefName":"feat/github-show-closed","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":189,"reviewDecision":"","reviewRequests":[],"reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABM8MK0Q","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThe current cache-save logic can violate the “cache only open lists” invariant if `x` is toggled while a list fetch is in flight, risking stale/mixed cache content.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nAdds a GitHub-page list toggle to include closed issues and merged/closed PRs, plus a `github-show-closed` config flag to control the initial state. This fits into `src/github/`’s list-pane + background-fetch model and updates docs/demos/fixtures so the behavior is reproducible without live API calls.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Add `x` toggle (`GhListAction::ToggleClosed` → `PaneEvent::ToggleClosed`) to re-fetch both issue/PR lists with `--state all`, dimming non-open items and marking the header with `GitHub · closed`.\n- Introduce `github-show-closed \"on\" | \"off\"` config (loader + merge allowlist) and wire it into GitHubState/panes.\n- Refresh fixture recordings, demo tape/GIFs, docs, and add/extend tests around toggling + config default/validation.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tape/fixtures/run_view_34443522358_--json_jobs.out | New recorded Actions run “jobs” fixture output. |\r\n| tape/fixtures/run_view_34443522261_--json_jobs.out | New recorded Actions run “jobs” fixture output. |\r\n| tape/fixtures/run_view_34443522014_--log_--job_102763327494.out | Recorded Actions job log fixture (added/updated). |\r\n| tape/fixtures/run_view_34443522014_--log_--job_102763306144.out | Recorded Actions job log fixture (added/updated). |\r\n| tape/fixtures/run_view_34443522014_--log_--job_102763305743.out | Recorded Actions job log fixture (added/updated). |\r\n| tape/fixtures/run_view_34443522014_--json_jobs.out | New recorded Actions run “jobs” fixture output. |\r\n| tape/fixtures/run_view_34441302809_--log_--job_102756731466.out | Recorded Actions job log fixture (added/updated). |\r\n| tape/fixtures/run_view_34441302809_--json_jobs.out | Removed/updated older recorded Actions run “jobs” fixture output. |\r\n| tape/fixtures/run_view_34440914114_--json_jobs.out | Removed/updated older recorded Actions run “jobs” fixture output. |\r\n| tape/fixtures/run_view_34440913700_--json_jobs.out | Removed/updated older recorded Actions run “jobs” fixture output. |\r\n| tape/fixtures/pr_view_86_--json_number_title_state_author_body_comments_reviews_labels_createdAt_reviewDecision_statusCheckRollup_additions_deletions_changedFiles_h.out | New recorded `gh pr view` fixture output (JSON). |\r\n| tape/fixtures/pr_view_84_--json_number_title_state_author_body_comments_reviews_labels_createdAt_reviewDecision_statusCheckRollup_additions_deletions_changedFiles_h.out | New recorded `gh pr view` fixture output (JSON). |\r\n| tape/fixtures/pr_view_184_--json_number_title_state_author_body_comments_reviews_labels_createdAt_reviewDecision_statusCheckRollup_additions_deletions_changedFiles.out | New recorded `gh pr view` fixture output (JSON). |\r\n| tape/fixtures/pr_view_181_--json_number_title_state_author_body_comments_reviews_labels_createdAt_reviewDecision_statusCheckRollup_additions_deletions_changedFiles.out | New recorded `gh pr view` fixture output (JSON). |\r\n| tape/fixtures/pr_view_176_--json_number_title_state_author_body_comments_reviews_labels_createdAt_reviewDecision_statusCheckRollup_additions_deletions_changedFiles.out | New recorded `gh pr view` fixture output (JSON). |\r\n| tape/fixtures/pr_view_175_--json_number_title_state_author_body_comments_reviews_labels_createdAt_reviewDecision_statusCheckRollup_additions_deletions_changedFiles.out | New recorded `gh pr view` fixture output (JSON). |\r\n| tape/fixtures/pr_view_172_--json_number_titl