ed recorded GraphQL meta fixture output. |\r\n| tape/fixtures/api_graphql_-f_query-pr-stacks_-F_owner_td72_-F_name_vig_-F_first_50.out | Updated recorded PR stacks GraphQL fixture output. |\r\n| tape/fixtures/api_-i_repos_owner_repo_issues_state_all_sort_updated_direction_desc_per_page_1.out | Updated recorded REST change-check fixture output. |\r\n| tape/demo-github-issue.tape | Demo updated to press `x` twice to show/hide closed items. |\r\n| src/github/state.rs | Wires show/hide-closed state, event handling, header rendering, and adds tests. |\r\n| src/github/panes/run_list.rs | Adapts list trait signature change (ignores closed flag). |\r\n| src/github/panes/pr_list.rs | Adds dim styling for non-open PR titles and fetches `--state all` when enabled. |\r\n| src/github/panes/issue_list.rs | Adds dim styling for closed issue titles and fetches `--state all` when enabled. |\r\n| src/github/panes/gh_list.rs | Adds toggle action/event and plumbs `show_closed` into fetch + cache-save behavior. |\r\n| src/github/domain/client.rs | Extends `gh issue list` / `gh pr list` to optionally include `--state all`. |\r\n| src/fixtures.rs | Records both list variants (open + all) for fixtures and details. |\r\n| src/core/ui/status_bar.rs | Shows `GitHub · closed` marker in the header when closed items are included. |\r\n| src/core/pane.rs | Adds `PaneEvent::ToggleClosed` for GitHub list toggling. |\r\n| src/core/config/merge.rs | Allows `github-show-closed` at top level during config merge. |\r\n| src/core/config/loader.rs | Adds `github_show_closed()` loader + validation + tests. |\r\n| README.md | Documents `x` toggle in GitHub view key table. |\r\n| docs/README.ja.md | Japanese README update for `x` toggle documentation. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-github.md | GitHub view guide updated to describe `x` behavior and header marker. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-github.md | Japanese GitHub view guide updated to describe `x` behavior. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/config-reference.md | Adds `github-show-closed` config reference section and defaults table row. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/config-reference.md | Japanese config reference updates for `github-show-closed`. |\r\n| assets/demo-projects.gif | Re-recorded demo GIF pointer updated. |\r\n| assets/demo-github-pr.gif | Re-recorded demo GIF pointer updated. |\r\n| assets/demo-github-issue.gif | Re-recorded demo GIF pointer updated. |\r\n| assets/default.kdl | Adds `github-show-closed` default + binds `x` in GitHub issue/PR list panes. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 132/143 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 1\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-09-10T06:18:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"9aa0adb2d69a3bfbf93ac9167a53a6bf2fd9c69d"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABM8N7mQ","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-09-10T06:22:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"9aa0adb2d69a3bfbf93ac9167a53a6bf2fd9c69d"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABM8Pt2A","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe implementation matches the stated behavior (toggle + config + header/status + cache invariant) and includes corresponding tests, docs, demo updates, and refreshed fixtures.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</su